{"ticker":{"symbol":"323350.KQ","name":"다원넥스뷰","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":13950.0,"change_pct":0.14909390444810544,"market_cap":111687901184.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":28100.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"South Korea","city":"Ansan-Si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.nexview.co.kr","business_summary":"Dawon Nexview Co., Ltd. engages in developing, manufacturing, selling, and servicing laser-based process automation systems for the industrial markets. It provides solutions for enhancing quality and productivity by laser joining systems for soldering, bonding, and welding; and laser machining systems for texturing, etching, engraving, marking, cutting, and scribing. The company's products include laser soldering, micro bonding, etching, and cutting systems. It serves the mass production lines of high-tech industries, such as semiconductor, display, mobile phone, automotive, and others. Dawon Nexview Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 2009 and is based in Ansan-Si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"다원넥스뷰(주)는 산업 시장을 위한 레이저 기반 공정 자동화 시스템을 개발, 제조, 판매 및 서비스하는 데 종사하고 있습니다. 납땜, 접합, 용접을 위한 레이저 접합 시스템을 통해 품질과 생산성을 향상시키는 솔루션을 제공합니다. 텍스처링, 에칭, 조각, 마킹, 절단 및 스크라이빙을 위한 레이저 가공 시스템. 이 회사의 제품에는 레이저 납땜, 마이크로 본딩, 에칭 및 절단 시스템이 포함됩니다. 반도체, 디스플레이, 휴대폰, 자동차 등 첨단 산업의 대량 생산 라인에 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 다원넥스뷰주식회사는 2009년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 안산시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"산업기계","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":10991070060.0,"operating_income":772804120.0,"net_income":9926162130.0,"eps":14.4},{"period":"2023","revenue":10653525630.0,"operating_income":-640963370.0,"net_income":88646830.0,"eps":-54.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":18702143950.0,"operating_income":1279144440.0,"net_income":-41423